{
  "bookId": "hero-213110",
  "id": "bond-28572",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28572001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "等你很久了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28572002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "哼，作为补偿，之后要带我们去个好玩的地方哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28572004",
              "text": "「我们」？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28572003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28572004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "怎么？没看到我的脚下还站着一只小可爱吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28572005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗，噗噗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28572007",
              "text": "喔，是「牡丹」呀。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28572006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28572007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "喂，你那个眼神是怎么回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28572008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "那种垂涎欲滴的馋鬼表情，我最熟悉不过了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28572010",
              "text": "我不是，我没有。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28572009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28572010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "最好没有，被我发现你打牡丹的注意，你就死定了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28572011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "藤林杏",
          "text": "牡丹是我最喜欢的宠物，谁都不可以伤害它。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28572012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "牡丹",
          "text": "噗噗，噗噗，噗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "28572",
